{"text":"It's remarkable, and it's a sign of great strength and great progress. Our nations are strongest when we see that we are all God's children, all equal in His eyes and worthy of His love. Across our two great countries, we have Hindus and Muslims, Christians and Sikhs and Jews and Buddhists and Jhans and so many faiths. And we remember the wisdom of Gandhiji, who said, For me, the different religions are beautiful flowers from the same garden, or they are branches of the same majestic tree. Branches of the same majestic tree. Our freedom of religion is written into our founding documents. It's part of America's very first amendment.","words":[{"text":"It's","start":0.0,"end":0.46},{"text":"remarkable","start":0.46,"end":0.76,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":1.5,"end":1.58},{"text":"it's","start":1.58,"end":1.7},{"text":"a","start":1.7,"end":1.82},{"text":"sign","start":1.82,"end":2.0},{"text":"of","start":2.0,"end":2.14},{"text":"great","start":2.14,"end":2.32},{"text":"strength","start":2.32,"end":2.76},{"text":"and","start":2.76,"end":2.92},{"text":"great","start":2.92,"end":3.12},{"text":"progress","start":3.12,"end":3.52,"punct":"."},{"text":"Our","start":5.5,"end":5.8},{"text":"nations","start":5.8,"end":6.0},{"text":"are","start":6.0,"end":6.24},{"text":"strongest","start":6.24,"end":6.6},{"text":"when","start":6.6,"end":6.9},{"text":"we","start":6.9,"end":7.06},{"text":"see","start":7.06,"end":7.34},{"text":"that","start":7.34,"end":7.68},{"text":"we","start":7.68,"end":7.8},{"text":"are","start":7.8,"end":7.94},{"text":"all","start":7.94,"end":8.12},{"text":"God's","start":8.12,"end":8.48},{"text":"children","start":8.48,"end":8.64,"punct":","},{"text":"all","start":9.1,"end":9.32},{"text":"equal","start":9.32,"end":9.62},{"text":"in","start":9.62,"end":9.8},{"text":"His","start":9.8,"end":9.96},{"text":"eyes","start":9.96,"end":10.2},{"text":"and","start":10.2,"end":10.42},{"text":"worthy","start":10.42,"end":10.64},{"text":"of","start":10.64,"end